description.narrative:
The 2nd ASEAN Ministerial Dialogue on Accelerating Actions to Achieve the Sustainable Development Goals aims to convene a platform for high-level discussion among the ministers and heads of national development planning agencies in ASEAN Member States and SDG coordinating agencies, on achieving the SDGs. The 2nd Ministerial Dialogue is expected to generate strategic guidance and continue the exchange of experiences among AMS. In particular, the ministers are requested to share their insights and guidance on the following: 

a)	Strategies to achieve the SDGs in the region while addressing the negative impacts of COVID-19 on sustainability agenda;
b)	Approaches to strengthen collaboration among national development planning agencies of AMS to foster partnership for sustainable development;
c)	Pathways to mainstream SDGs in the work of ASEAN including the ASEAN Community post-2025 vision; and 
d)	Ways forward to enhance financing for sustainable development.
